<!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->
<h1 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#Gerrit-Code-Review"></a><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#gerrit-code-review"></a>Gerrit Code Review</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><a href="https://www.gerritcodereview.com/">Gerrit</a>&nbsp;is a code review and project management tool for Git based projects.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"linkDestination":"custom"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image"><a href="https://gerrit-ci.gerritforge.com/view/Gerrit/job/Gerrit-bazel-master/"><img src="https://gerrit-ci.gerritforge.com/view/Gerrit/job/Gerrit-bazel-master/badge/icon" alt="Build Status"/></a></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:image -->
<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://img.shields.io/maven-central/v/com.google.gerrit/gerrit-war" alt="Maven Central"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#Objective"></a><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#objective"></a>Objective</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Gerrit makes reviews easier by showing changes in a side-by-side display, and allowing inline comments to be added by any reviewer.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Gerrit simplifies Git based project maintainership by permitting any authorized user to submit changes to the master Git repository, rather than requiring all approved changes to be merged in by hand by the project maintainer.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#Documentation"></a><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#documentation"></a>Documentation</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>For information about how to install and use Gerrit, refer to&nbsp;<a href="https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/index.html">the documentation</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#Source"></a><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#source"></a>Source</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Our canonical Git repository is located on&nbsp;<a href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit">googlesource.com</a>. There is a mirror of the repository on&nbsp;<a href="https://github.com/GerritCodeReview/gerrit">Github</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#Reporting-bugs"></a><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#reporting-bugs"></a>Reporting bugs</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Please report bugs on the&nbsp;<a href="https://bugs.chromium.org/p/gerrit/issues/list">issue tracker</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#Contribute"></a><a class="h" href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/heads/master#contribute"></a>Contribute</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Gerrit is the work of hundreds of contributors. We appreciate your help!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Please read the&nbsp;<a href="https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/master/SUBMITTING_PATCHES">contribution guidelines</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Note that we do not accept Pull Requests via the Github mirror.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

